```
Purpose: Flag VPN logins from a new/unusual geographic location for a user
within a short time window of their last known-good login (impossible
travel / anomalous VPN access).

Data source: index=vpn sourcetype=vpn:auth (adjust to your TA/sourcetype)

False positive notes: Corporate VPN exit nodes shared across regions,
users legitimately traveling, mobile carrier IP reassignment.

Response action: Triage against user travel/ticket history; if unconfirmed,
escalate for password reset + MFA re-enrollment review.
```

index=vpn sourcetype=vpn:auth action=success
| iplocation src_ip
| stats earliest(_time) as first_seen latest(_time) as last_seen
        values(Country) as countries values(src_ip) as ips
        by user
| where mvcount(countries) > 1
| eval time_between_logins_min = (last_seen - first_seen) / 60
| where time_between_logins_min < 240
| table user countries ips first_seen last_seen time_between_logins_min
| sort - time_between_logins_min
